'''Lily of the Sands''' is an item that can be obtained as a reward from the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. They are used to create [[Menaphite remedies]] at 88 [[Herblore]] by using them on an [[Dwarf weed potion (unf)|unfinished dwarf weed potion]].

